{
  "uid": "sap-gw-failures",
  "title": "SAP Gateway · Investigação de falhas",
  "description": "Localize falhas por período, rota, usuário, operação SOAP e tipo de erro, e navegue de log para trace.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "tags": [
    "sap-gateway"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "DS_LOKI",
        "label": "Loki",
        "query": "loki",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "Loki",
          "value": "loki"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "DS_TEMPO",
        "label": "Tempo",
        "query": "tempo",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "Tempo",
          "value": "tempo"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "DS_PROM",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, deployment_environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, deployment_environment)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "username",
        "label": "Usuário (regex)",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": ".*",
            "value": ".*"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "route",
        "label": "Rota (regex)",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": ".*",
            "value": ".*"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "soap_operation",
        "label": "Operação SOAP (regex)",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": ".*",
            "value": ".*"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "textbox",
        "name": "error_type",
        "label": "Tipo de erro (regex)",
        "query": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": ".+",
          "value": ".+"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": ".+",
            "value": ".+"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "Dashboards SAP Gateway",
      "tags": [
        "sap-gateway"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Fluxo de investigação",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. **Quando** — veja os picos de falhas abaixo e ajuste o período.  \n2. **Quem/onde** — filtre por usuário, rota, operação SOAP ou tipo de erro (regex).  \n3. **Por quê** — na lista de logs, abra o campo **TraceID → Abrir trace**; no trace, o botão *Logs* mostra os logs do mesmo `trace_id`.  \nTipos de erro: `soap_fault`, `timeout`, `connection`, `http_status`, `invalid_response`, `authentication`, `authorization`, `wsdl_unavailable`, `not_found`, ..."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Respostas HTTP 4xx/5xx por rota",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route, http_response_status_code) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{deployment_environment=~\"$env\",http_response_status_code=~\"[45]..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}} · {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas SOAP por categoria",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (soap_operation, error_type) (increase(soap_client_calls_total{deployment_environment=~\"$env\",error_type=~\".+\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{soap_operation}} · {{error_type}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas por usuário (logs)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "label_replace(sum by (username) (count_over_time({service_name=\"sap-gateway\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} |= \"http request completed\" | error_type=~\"$error_type\" | username=~\"$username\" | http_route=~\"$route\" | soap_operation=~\"$soap_operation\" [$__interval])), \"username\", \"(sem usuário)\", \"username\", \"^$\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{username}}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Falhas por rota, usuário e erro",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route, username, error_type, soap_operation) (count_over_time({service_name=\"sap-gateway\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} |= \"http request completed\" | error_type=~\"$error_type\" | username=~\"$username\" | http_route=~\"$route\" | soap_operation=~\"$soap_operation\" [$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "ocorrências",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "ocorrências",
              "http_route": "rota",
              "username": "usuário",
              "error_type": "erro",
              "soap_operation": "operação SOAP"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs de falha (com link para o trace)",
      "description": "Inclui logs de acesso e de chamadas SOAP com error_type. Campo TraceID → abrir trace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"sap-gateway\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} | error_type=~\"$error_type\" | username=~\"$username\" | http_route=~\"$route\" | soap_operation=~\"$soap_operation\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "maxLines": 200
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces com erro (Tempo / TraceQL)",
      "description": "Spans em erro. O span SOAP traz soap.operation, soap.attempts e error.type.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ status = error && span.enduser.id =~ \"$username\" }",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "filters": []
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces lentos (> 1 s)",
      "description": "Requisições com mais de 1 segundo — inclua retries e timeouts SOAP.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ kind = server && duration > 1s }",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "filters": []
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      }
    }
  ]
}
